        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-708, Simple Beveled Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDespite, or because of, the Double Ringed Cabinet Knob's simple design it will surely be a beautiful addition to any cabinet. It is available in two sizes and 7 finishes. What is great about this cabinet hardware is that no matter which size or finish you choose, it will still look great, a simple classic for almost any style home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International Ringed Cabinet Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-708:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-707:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
